  "body": "Set on a fully fenced 493sqm (more or less) section, this brand-new luxury residence offers 5 spacious bedrooms and 4.5 bathrooms, secured behind an electric gate for added privacy and peace of mind. The property features a double internal-access garage with integrated laundry, along with two additional off-street car parks. Combining low-maintenance grounds with impressive street appeal, this home is thoughtfully designed to accommodate evolving family needs without compromising on style, comfort or functionality.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor offers a beautifully appointed private lounge featuring impressive 3-metre stud ceilings, full-height sliding doors and its own heat pump. Adding another dimension of flexibility is a separate-access one-bedroom suite, complete with its own living area, ensuite, walk-in wardrobe and independent heat pump. Whether accommodating extended family, providing private guest accommodation or exploring rental income opportunities, this thoughtfully designed space offers exceptional versatility.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining and living area enjoys abundant natural light and seamless access to a private outdoor deck. The designer kitchen makes a striking statement with its sophisticated dark colour palette, premium appliances, bespoke cabinetry and designer lighting. A dedicated secondary scullery, complete with a gas cooktop, provides additional preparation and cooking space while keeping the main kitchen beautifully presented.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a further family living area opens onto a suspended balcony, where sweeping, uninterrupted reserve views create a beautiful backdrop for everyday living. Four well-proportioned bedrooms provide comfortable accommodation, including two luxurious master suites, each featuring an ensuite and walk-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nComfort is assured throughout the seasons with ducted, multi-zone air conditioning servicing the main living areas and upstairs bedrooms, complemented by individual heat pumps in the downstairs lounge and separate-access suite.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of Long Bay living, with Long Bay Village, beautiful beaches, the Regional Park, sports fields, playgrounds and highly regarded schools all just minutes away.",
